#
# The NVIDIA edition's units (step 1.11b, ADR 0022). RPM Fusion ships
# nvidia-fallback.service without enabling it: it loads nouveau when the NVIDIA
# module didn't load, so the desktop works before Lumen's key is enrolled.
enable nvidia-fallback.service
